<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4296" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλιτ-ήριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλιτεῖν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sinning</i> or <i>offending against</i>, c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀλιτηρίων . . τῶν τῆς θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					445
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναγεῖς καὶ ἀ. τῆς θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.126
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινὸν ἀλιτήριον τῶν
				ὀλωλότων. . ἁπάντων</span> common <i>plague</i> of all,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.159
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλιτήριος Ἑλλάδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.157
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Din.
				1.77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>guilty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.197
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				13.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.130
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πρωταγόρας . .
			ἁλιτήριος</span> (i.e.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἀ.</span>)
				<i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				146b
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				96
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				563
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλάστωρ</span>
			, <i>avenging spirit</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				4.1.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.2.8
			</span></i>.</div>
